  "slug": "llm-transpile",
  "name": "Llm Transpile",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Token-optimized document reader — silently compresses .md, .html, and .txt files on every Read, cutting context usage by ~30% with zero workflow change. Adaptive 4-stage compression auto-escalates as token budget fills.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install llm-transpile@claude-community` from `epicsagas/llm-transpile`.\n\nToken-optimized document transpiler for LLM pipelines\n\nToken-optimized document reader — silently compresses .md, .html, and .txt files on every Read, cutting context usage by ~30% with zero workflow change. Adaptive 4-stage compression auto-escalates as token budget fills.",
